{
  "title": "Ziyaarat-e-Aal-e-Yaaseen",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "سَلَامٌ عَلٰى آلِ يٰسٓ\nSALAAMUN A’LAA AALE YAASEEN \nPeace be upon (the) progeny of Yaseen.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَادَاعِىَ الله\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA DAA-E’YAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O the caller of Allah \nوَ رَبَّا نِىَّ اٰيَاتِهٖ \nWA RABBAANIYYA AAYAATEHI \nand place of manifestation of His signs.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَابَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAABAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O the door of Allah \nوَ دَيَّانَ دِيْنِهٖ \nWA DAYYAANA DEENEHI \nand the devout one of His religion.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَلِيْفَةَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHALEEFATAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O the vicegerent of Allah \nوَ نَا صِرَ حَقِهٖ \nWA NAASERA HAQQEHI \nand the helper of His truth.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O the proof of Allah \nوَ دَلِيْلَا اِرَادَتِهٖ \nWA DALEELA ERAADATEHI \nand the Guide of His intention.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا تَالِىَ كِتَابِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA TAALEYA KETAABIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O the reciter of Allah’s book \nوَ تَرْجُمَا نَهٗ \nWA TARJOMAANEHI \nand its interpreter.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ فِىْ اٰنَآءِ لَيْلِكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA FEE AANAAA-E LAYLEKA \nPeace be upon you in your night \nوَ اَطْرَافِ نَهَارِكَ \nWA ATRAAFE NAHAAREKA \nand in your day.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَقِيَّةَ اللهِ فِىْ اَرْضِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAQIYYATAL LAAHE FEE ARZEHI \nPeace be upon you, O the remnant of Allah on His earth.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مِيْثَاقَ اللهِ الَّذِىْ اَخَذَهٗ وَ وَكَّدَهٗ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MEESAAQAL LAAHIL LAZEE AKHAZAHU WA WAKKADAHU \nPeace be upon you, O the covenant of Allah, which He took it and He fastened it.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَعْدَ اللهِ الَّذِىْ ضَمِنَهٗ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WA’DAL LAAHIL LAZEE ZAMENAHU \nPeace be upon you, O the promise of Allah which He guaranteed it.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَلَمُ الْمَنْصُوْبُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL A’LAMUL MANSOOBO \nPeace by upon you, O the manifested flag \nوَ الْعِلْمُ الْمَصْبُوْبُ \nWAL I’LMUL MASBOOBO \nand the one who is filled with knowledge\nوَ الْغَوْثُ \nWAL GHAWSO \nand the help\nوَ الرَّحْمَةُ الْوَاسِعَةُ \nWAR-RAHMATUL WAASE-A’TO \nand the far-reaching mercy\nوَعْدًا غَيْرَ مَكْذُوْبٍ \nWA’DAN GHAYRA MAKZOOBIN \na promise which is not a lie.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تَقُوْمُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TAQOOMO \nPeace be upon you while you are standing\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تَقْعُدُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TAQ-O’DO \nPeace be upon you while you are sitting.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تَقْرَءُ وَ تُبَيِّنُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TAQRA-O WA TOBAYYENO \nPeace be upon you when you are reading and explaining\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تُصَلِّىْ وَ تَقْنُتُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TOSALLEE WA TAQNOTO \nPeace be upon you when you are praying and supplicating.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تَرْكُعُ وَ تَسْجُدُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TAR-KA-O’ WA TASJODO \nPeace be upon you when you are bowing and prostrating.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تُهَلِّلُ وَ تُكَبِّرُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TOHALLELO WA TOKABBERO \nPeace be upon you when you are saying ‘There is no God except Allah’ and (when) you are saying ‘Allah is greater (than what He is described).’\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تَحْمَدُ وَ تَسْتَغْفِرُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TAHMADO WA TASTAGH-FERO \nPeace be upon you when you are praising (Allah) and seeking forgiveness.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ حِيْنَ تُصْبِحُ وَ تُمْسِىْ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA HEENA TUSBEHO WA TUMSEE \nPeace be upon you when you enter the morning and the evening.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ فِى اللَّيْلِ اِذَا يَغْشٰى \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA FIL LAYLE EZAA YAGH-SHAA \nPeace be upon you in the night when it envelops\nوَ النَّهَارِ اِذَا تَجَلّٰى \nWAN NAHAARE EZAA TAJALLAA \nand the day when it becomes manifest.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْمَاْمُوْنُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL MAAMOONO \nPeace be upon you, O the leader, the protected one.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْمُقَدَّمُ الْمَاْمُوْلُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MOQADDAMUL MAAMOOLO \nPeace be upon you, O the prior hoped one.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ بِجَوَامِعِ السَّلَامِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA BE-JAWAAME-I’S SALAAME \nPeace be upon you by the collections of the salutations.\nاُشْهِدُكَ يَا مَوْلَاىَ \nUSH-HEDOKA YAA MAWLAAYA \nI call you as a witness, O my Master\nاَنِّىْ اَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ \nANNEE ASH-HADO AN LAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAHDAHU LAA SHAREEKA LAHU \nCertainly I testify that there is no god except Allah, He is alone, there is no partner with Him.\nوَ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدً عَبْدُهٗ وَ رَسُوْلُهٗ \nWA ANNA MOHAMMADAN A’BDOHU WA RASOOLOHU \nAnd indeed I testify that Muhammad is His servant and His messenger;\nلَا حَبِيْبَ اِلَّا هُوَ وَ اَهْلُهٗ \nLAA HABEEBA ILLAA HOWA WA AHLOHU \nThere is no beloved except him and his progeny.\nوَ اُشْهِدُكَ يَا مَوْلَا يَ\nWA USH-HEDOKA YAA MAWLAAYA \nAnd I call you as a witness, O my Master \nاَنَّ عَلِيًّا اَمِيْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ حُجَّتُهٗ \nANNA A’LIYYAN AMEERAL MOMENEENA HUJJATOHU \ncertainly Ali, the commander of the believers is His proof.\nوَ الْحَسَنَ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWAL HASANA HUJJATOHU \nAnd Hasan is His proof.\nوَ الْحُسَيْنَ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWAL HUSAYNA HUJJATOHU \nAnd Husain is His proof.\nوَ عَلِىَّ ابْنَ الْحُسَيْنِ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWA A’LIYYAB NAL HUSAYNE HUJJATOHU \nAnd Ali, son of Husain is His proof.\nوَ مُحَمَّدْ بْنَ عَلِىٍّ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWA MOHAMMAD ABNA A’LIYYIN HUJJATOHU \nAnd Muhammad, son of Ali is His proof.\nوَ جَعْفَرَ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWA JA’FAR ABNA MOHAMMADIN HUJJATOHU \nAnd Ja’far, son of Muhammad is His proof.\nوَ مُوْسَى بْنَ جَعْفَرٍ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWA MOOSABNA JA’FARIN HUJJATOHU\nAnd Moosa, son of Ja’far is His proof.\nوَ عَلَىِّ بْنَ مُوْسٰى حُجَّتُهٗ \nWA A’LIYYIBNA MOOSAA HUJJATOHU \nAnd Ali, son of Moosa is His proof.\nوَ مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ عَلِىٍّ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWA MOHAMMADABNA A’LIYYIN HUJJATOHU\nAnd Muhammad, son of Ali is His proof.\nوَ عَلِىَّ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWA A’LIYYABNA MOHAMMADIN HUJJATOHU \nAnd Ali, son of Muhammad is His proof.\nوَ الْحَسَنَ بْنَ عَلِىٍّ حُجَّتُهٗ \nWAL HASANABNA A’LIYYIN HUJJATOHU \nAnd Hasan, son of Ali is His proof.\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ حُجَّةُ اللهِ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA HUJJATUL LAAHE \nAnd I testify that indeed you are the proof of Allah.\nاَنْتُمُ الْاَوَّلُ وَ الْاٰخِرُ \nANTOMUL AWWALO WAL AAKHERO \nAll of you, the first and the last.\nوَ اَنَّ رَجْعَتَكُمْ حَقٌّ\nWA ANNA RAJ-A’TAKUM HAQQUN \nAnd surely your return is a truth, \nلَا رَيْبَ فِيْهَا \nLAA RAYBA FEEHAA \nthere is no doubt in it.\nيَوْمَ لَا يَنْفَعُ نَفْسًا اِيْمَا نُهَا\nYAWMA LAA YANFA-O’ NAFSAN EEMAANOHAA \nThe day when belief of none will benefit himself \nلَمْ تَكُنْ اٰمَنَتْ مِنْ قَبْلُ\nLAM TAKUN AAMANAT MIN QABLO \nwho previously did not believe \nاَوْكَسَبَتْ فِىْ اِيْمَانِهَا خَيْرًا \nAW KASABAT FEE EEMAANEHAA KHAYRAN\nor acquired a goodness through his belief.\nوَ اَنَّ الْمُوْتَ حَقٌّ \nWA ANNAL MAWTA HAQQUN \nAnd indeed death is a truth.\nوَ اَنَّ نَاكِرًا وَ نَكِيْرًا حَقٌّ \nWA ANNA NAAKERAN WA NAKEERAN HAQQUN \nAnd indeed Naakir and Nakeer is a truth.\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّ النَّشْرَ حَقٌّ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAN NASHRA HAQQUN \nAnd I testify that indeed the scattering (stage of Qiyamat) is a truth \nوَ الْبَعْثَ حَقٌّ \nWAL BA’SA HAQQUN \nand the raising is a truth.\nوَ اَنَّ الصِّرَاطَ حَقٌّ\nWA ANNAS SERAATA HAQQUN \nAnd indeed the bridge (over hell) is a truth \nوَ الْمِرْصَادَ حَقٌّ \nWAL MIRSAADA HAQQUN \nand the watching place is a truth.\nوَ الْمِيْزَانَ حَقٌّ\nWAL MEEZAANA HAQQUN \nAnd the balance is a truth \nوَ الْحَشْرَ حَقٌّ \nWAL HASHRA HAQQUN \nand the gathering is a truth\nوَ الْحِسَابَ حَقٌّ\nWAL HESAABA HAQQUN \nAnd the accounting (of deeds) is a truth \nوَ الْجَنَّةَ حَقٌّ\nWAL JANNATA HAQQUN \nand the Paradise \nوَ النَّارَ حَقٌّ \nWAN NAARA HAQQUN \nand the hell is a truth.\nوَ الْوَعْدَ وَ الْوَعِيْدَ بِهِمَا حَقٌّ \nWAL WA’DA WAL WA-E’EDA BEHEMAA HAQQUN \nAnd the promise (of reward) and the threat (of the punishment) in them is a truth.\nيَا مَوْلَايَ شَقِىَ مَنْ خَالَفَكُمْ \nYAA MAWLAAYA SHA-QEYA MAN KHAALAFAKUM \nO my Master, one who opposes you is unlucky.\nوَ سَعِدَ مَنْ اَطَاعَكُمْ \nWA SA-E’DA MAN A-TAA-A’KUM\nAnd one who obeys you is lucky.\nفَاَشْهَدْ عَلٰى مَا اَشْهَدْ تُكَ عَلَيْهِ \nFASH-HAD A’LAA MAA ASH-HADTOKA A’LAYHE\nThen testify whatever I made you a witness upon it.\nوَ اَنَا وَ لِىٌّ لَكَ\nWA ANAA WALIYYUN LAKA \nAnd I am a friend for you, \nبَرِىْءٌ مِنْ عَدُوِّكَ \nBAREE-UN MIN A’DUWWEKUM \nacquitted from your enemy.\nفَالْحَقُّ مَا رَضِيْتُمُوْهُ \nFAL HAQQO MAA RAZEETOMOOHO\nSo the truth is whatever you are satisfied with.\nوَ الْبَاطِلُ مَا اَسْخَطْتُمُوْهُ \nWAL BAATELO MAA ASKHAT-TOMOOHO \nAnd the untrue is whatever you are angry with.\nوَ الْمَعْرُوْفُ مَا اَمَرْتُمْ بِهٖ \nWAL MA’ROOFO MAA AMARTUM BEHI \nAnd the goodness is whatever you ordered.\nوَ الْمُنْكَرُ مَا نَهَيْتُمْ عَنْهُ \nWAL MUNKARO MAA NAHAYTUM A’NHO \nAnd the evil is whatever you have prohibited from.\nفَنَفْسِىْ مُؤْمِنَةٌ بِاللهِ\nFA-NAFSEE MOA-MENATAN BILLAAHE \nSo I am a believer in Allah, \nوَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ \nWAHDAHU LAA SHAREEKA LAHU \nHe alone, there is no partner with Him.\nوَ بِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَ بِاَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nWA BE-RASOOLEHI WA BE AMEERIL MOMENEENA \nAnd (I am a believer) in His messenger and in the commander of the believers.\nوَ بِكُمْ يَا مَوْلَاىَ اَوَّلِكُمْ وَ اٰخِرِكُمْ \nWA BEKUM YAA MAWLAAYA AWWALEKUM WA AAKHEREKUM \nAnd in you O my Master, the first among you and the last among you.\nوَ نُصْرَ تِىْ مُعَدَّةُ لَكُمْ \nWA NUSRATEE MO-A’DDATAN LAKUM \nAnd my help is intended for you.\nوَ مَوَدَّتِىْ خَالِصَةٌ لَكُمْ \nWA MAWADDEE KHAALESATAN LAKUM \nAnd my love is purely for you.\nاٰمِيْنَ اٰمِيْنَ.\nAAMEENA AAMEENA \nAmen! Amen! (Accept! Accept!)\nDua to be recited after Ziyarat\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْٓ اَسْئَلُكَ اَنْ تُصَلِّیَ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA AN TOSALLEYA A’LAA MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, surely I ask You that You send blessings upon Muhammad (s.a.w.a.)\nنَّبِیِّ رَحْمَتِكَ وَ كَلِمَۃِ نُوْرِكَ \nNABIYYIR RAHMATEKA WA KALEMATE NOOREKA \nThe prophet of Your mercy and the word of your light.\nوَ اَنْ تَمْلَاَ قَلْبِیْ نُوْرَ الْیَقِیْنِ \nWA AN TAMLA-A QALBEE NOORAL YAQEENE\nAnd fill my heart with the light of certainty\nوَ صَدْرِیْ نُوْرَا الْاِیْمَانِ \nWA SADREE NOORAL EEMAANE \nAnd my chest with light of faith.\nوَ فِكْرِیْ نُوْرَالنِّیَّاتِ \nWA FIQREE NOORAN NIYYAATE\nAnd my thinking with the light of intentions.\nوَ عَزْمِیْ نُوْرَ الْعِلْمِ \nWA A’ZMEE NOORAL I’LME \nAnd my determination with the light of knowledge.\nوَ قُوَّتِیْ نُوْرَ الْعَمَلِ \nWA QUWWATEE NOORAL A’MALE\nAnd my strength with the light of action.\nوَ لِسَانِیْ نُوْرَالصِّدْقِ \nWA LESAANEE NOORAS SIDQE \nAnd my tongue with the light of truthfulness.\nوَ دِیْنِیْ نُوْرَ الْبَصَآئِرِ مِنْ عِنْدِكَ\nWA DEENEE NOORAL BASAAA-ERE MIN I’NDEKA \nAnd my religion with the light of understanding from You.\nوَ بَصَرِیْ نُوْرَ الضِّیَآءِ \nWA BASAREE NOORAZ ZEYAAA-E \nAnd my vision with brightness.\nوَ سَمْعِیْ نُوْرَ الْحِكْمَۃِ \nWA SAM-E’E NOORAL HIKMATE\nAnd my hearing with the light of wisdom.\nوَ مَوَدَّتِیْ نُوْرَ الْمُوَالَاۃِ\nWA MAWADDATEE NOORAL MOWAALAATE\nAnd my love with the light of friendship \nلِمُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِهٖ عَلَیْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nLE-MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI A’LAYHEMUS SALAAMO \nfor Muhammad (s.a.w.a.) and his progeny. Peace be upon (all of) them \nحَتّٰی اَلْقَاكَ \nHATTAA ALQAAKA \nuntil I meet You.\nوَ قَدْ وَفَیْتُ بِعَهْدِكَ وَ مِیْثَاقِكَ \nWA QAD WAFAYTO BE-A’HDEKA WA MEESAAQEKA \nAnd certainly I discharged Your promise and Your covenant.\nفَتُغَشِّیَنِیْ رَحْمَتُكَ\nFA-TOGHASH-SHEYANEE RAHMATOKA \nیَا وَلِیُّ یَا حَمِیْدُ \nYAA WALIYYO YAA HAMEEDO\nSo You cover me with Your mercy, \nO Master ! O Praiseworthy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ حُجَّتِكَ فِیْٓ اَرْضِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN HUJJATEKA FEE ARZEKA \nO Allah send Your blessings upon Muhammad, Your proof on Your earth.\nوَ خَلِیْفَتِكَ فِیْ بِلَادِكَ \nWA KHALEEFATEKA FEE BELAADEKA \nAnd Your vicegerent of Your cities.\nوَ الدَّاعِیْ اِلٰی سَبِیْلِكَ \nWAD-DAAA-E’E ELAA SABEELEKA \nAnd the caller towards Your way.\nوَ الْقَآئِمِ بِقِسْطِكَ \nWAL QAAA-EME BE-QISTEKA\nAnd the upright by Your justice.\nوَ الثَّآئِرِ بِاَمْرِكَ \nWAS-SAAA-ERE BE-AMREKA \nAnd the one who arouses by Your command.\nوَلِیِّ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nWALIYYIL MOMENEENA \nThe master of the believer\nوَ بَوَارِ الْكَافِرِیْنَ \nWA BAWAARIL KAAFEREENA \nand the perdition of the disbelievers.\nوَ مُجَلِّی الظُّلْمَۃِ \nWA MOJALLIZ ZULMATE \nAnd the enlighter of the darkness.\nوَ مُنِیْرِ الْحَقِّ \nWA MONEERIL HAQQE \nAnd the illuminator of the truth.\nوَ النَّاطِقِ بِالْحِكْمَۃِ وَ الصِّدْقِ \nWAN-NAATEQE BIL-HIKMATE WAS SIDQE\nAnd the speaker with the wisdom and the truth.\nوَ كَلِمَتِكَ التَّآمَّۃِ فِیْٓ اَرْضِكَ \nWA KALEMATEKAT TAAMMATE FEE ARZEKAL\nAnd Your complete word on Your earth.\nالْمُرْتَقِبِ الْخَآئِفِ\nMURTAQEBIL KHAAA-EFE \nThe anxious anticipator \nوَ الْوَلِیِّ النَّاصِحِ\nWAL WALIYYIN NAASEHE \nand the counseling Master, \nسَفِیْنَۃِ النَّجَاۃِ \nSAFEENATIN NAJAATE \nthe ship of salvation.\nوَ عَلَمِ الْهُدٰی\nWA A’LAMIL HODAA\nAnd the flag of guidance \nوَ نُوْرِ اَبْصَارِ الْوَرٰی \nWA NOORE ABSAARIL WARAA \nand the light of the sight of mankind.\nوَ خَیْرِ مَنْ تَقَمَّصَ وَ ارْتَدٰی\nWA KHAYRE MAN TAQAMMASA WAR TADAA\nAnd best of he who was attired and was clothed \nوَ مُجَلِّی الْعَمَی \nWA MOJALLIL A’MAL\nand the illuminator of the blind.\nالَّذِیْ یَمْلَاُ الْاَرْضَ عَدْلًا وَّ قِسْطًا\nLAZEE YAMLA-UL ARZA A’DLAN WA QISTAN\nThe one who will fill the earth with justice and equity just\nكَمَا مُلِئَتْ ظُلْمًا وَّ جَوْرًا \nKAMAA MOLE-AT ZULMAN WA JAWRAN\nas it was filled with injustice and oppression.\nاِنَّكَ عَلٰی كُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِیْرٌ \nINNAKA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN\nSurely You are powerful over everything.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی وَلِیِّكَ وَ ابْنِ اَوْلِیَآئِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA WALIYYEKA WABNE AWLEYAAA-EKAL\nO Allah send your blessings upon Your friend and son of Your friends.\nالَّذِیْنَ فَرَضْتَ طَاعَتَهُمْ \nLAZEENA FARAZTA TAA-A’TAHUM\nThose whom You have ordered (for) obeying them.\nوَ اَوْجَبْتَ حَقَّهُمْ \nWA AWJABTA HAQQAHUM \nAnd You made (the observation of) their rights compulsory\nوَ اَذْهَبْتَ عَنْهُمُ الرِّجْسَ وَ طَهَّرْتَهُمْ تَطْهِیْرًا \nWA AZHABTA A’NHOMUR RIZSA WA TAHHARTAHUM TATHEERAN \nAnd You removed from them the uncleanliness and purified them a thorough purifying.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ انْصُرْهُ\nALLAAHUMMAN SURHO\nوَ انْتَصِرْ بِهٖ لِدِیْنِكَ \nWAN TASIR BEHI LEDEENEKA\nO Allah help him and come to the aid of Your religion through him\nوَ انْصُرْ بِهٖ اَوْلِیَآئَكَ وَ اَوْلِیَآئَهٗ\nWAN SUR BEHI AWLEYAAA-AKA WA ALWEYAA-AHU \nAnd help Your friends and his friends \nوَ شِیْعَتَهٗ وَ اَنْصَارَهٗ \nWA SHEE-A’TAHU WA ANSAARAHU \nand his followers and his helpers through him.\nوَ اجْعَلْنَا مِنْهُمْ \nWAJ A’LNAA MINHUM \nAnd place us among them.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَعِذْهُ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ بَاغٍ وَّ طَاغٍ \nALLAAHUMMA A-I’ZHO MIN SHARRE KULLE BAAGHIN WA TAAGHIN \nO Allah protect him from the evil of every tyrant and despot.\nوَّ مِنْ شَرِّ جَمِیْعِ خَلْقِكَ \nWA MIN SHARRE JAMEE-E’ KHALQEKA \nAnd from the evil of all your creatures.\nوَ احْفَظْهُ مِنْۢ بَیْنِ یَدَیْهِ وَ مِنْ خَلْفِهٖ\nWAH FAZHO MIM BAYNE YADAYHE WA MIN KHALFEHI\nAnd protect him from his front \nوَ عَنْ یَّمِیْنِهٖ وَ عَنْ شِمَالِهٖ \nWA A’NY YAMEENEHI WA A’N SHEMAALEHI \nand his back and his right and from his left.\nوَ احْرُسْهُ وَ امْنَعْهُ مِنْ اَنْ یُّوْصَلَ اِلَیْهِ بِسُوْٓءٍ \nWAHRUSHO WAM-NA’HO MIN AYN YOOSALA ELAYHE BE-SOOO-IN \nAnd protect him and prevent from him the reaching of any evil.\nوَّ احْفَظْ فِیْهِ رَسُوْلَكَ وَ اٰلَ رَسُوْلِكَ \nWAH FAZHO FEEHE RASOOLAKA WA AALA RASOOLEKA \nAnd protect Your messenger and the progeny of Your messenger through him.\nوَ اَظْهِرْ بِهِ الْعَدْلَ \nWA AZHIR BEHIL A’DLA \nAnd make the justice manifest through him.\nوَ اَیِّدْهُ بِالنَّصْرِ \nWA AYYIDHO BIN-NASRE \nAnd support him by the victory.\nوَ انْصُرْ نَاصِرِیْهِ\nWAN SUR NAASEREEHE \nAnd help his helpers and abandon his deserters.\nوَ اخْذُلْ خَاذِلِیْهِ \nWAKH ZUL KHAAZELEEHE \nوَ اقْصِمْ قَاصِمِیْهِ\nWAQ SIM QAASEMEEHE \nAnd break up his dividers \nوَ اقْصِمْ بِهٖ جَبَابِرَۃَ الْكُفْرِ \nWAQ SIM BEHI JABAABERATAL KUFRE \nand break up the giants of disbelief through him.\nوَ اقْتُلْ بِهِ الْكُفَّارَ وَ الْمُنَافِقِیْنَ\nWAQ TUL BEHIL KUFFAARA WAL MONAAFEQEENA \nAnd through him kill the disbelievers and the hypocrites\nوَ جَمِیْعَ الْمُلْحِدِیْنَ \nWA JAMEE-I’L MULHEDEENA \nand all the heretics.\nحَیْثُ كَانُوْا مِنْ مَّشَارِقِ الْاَرْضِ وَ مَغَارِبِهَا\nHAYSO KAANU MIM MASHAAREQIL ARZE WA MAGHAAREBEHAA\nWherever they be, in the east of the earth and its west, \nبَرِّهَا وَ بَحْرِهَا \nBARREHAA WA BAHREHAA \nits land and its sea.\nوَامْلَأْ بِهِ الْاَرْضَ عَدْلًا \nWAM LAA BEHIL ARZA A’DLANW\nAnd fill the earth with justice through him.\nوَّ اَظْهِرْ بِهٖ دِیْنَ نَبِیِّكَ\nWA AZHIR BEHI DEENA NABIYYEKA\nصَلَّی اللّٰهُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ \nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nAnd manifest the religion of your prophet, blessings be upon him and his progeny through him.\nوَ اجْعَلْنِیْ اَللّٰهُمَّ مِنْ اَنْصَارِهٖ وَ اَعْوَانِهٖ\nWAJ A’LNEE ALLAAHUMMA MIN ANSAAREHI WA A-A’WAANEHI\nAnd place me, O Allah, among his helpers and his aiders\nوَ اَتْبَاعِهٖ وَ شِیْعَتِهٖ \nWA ATBAA-E’HI WA SHEE-A’TEHI\nand his followers and his partisans.\nوَ اَرِنِیْ فِیْٓ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَیْهِمُ السَّلَامُ مَا یَاْمُلُوْنَ \nWA ARENEE FEE AALE MOHAMMADIN A’LAYHEMUS SALAAMO MAA YAAMOLOONA\nAnd show me in the progeny of Muhammad peace be upon them, whatever they are hoping.\nوَ فِیْ عَدُوِّهِمْ مَا یَحْذَرُوْنَ \nWA FEE A’DUWWEHIM MAA YAHZAROONA\nAnd in their enemies whatever the enemies are afraid (of).\nاِلٰهَ الْحَقِّ اٰمِیْنَ \nELAAHAL HAQQE AAMEENA\nO God of the truth, Amen (Accept).\nیَا ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَ الْاِكْرَامِ\nYAA ZAL JALAALE WAL IKRAAME \nO the possessor of splendour and honour! \nیَآ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ.\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA.\nO the most merciful of all the mercifuls."
}
